# The repo was authored on Linux and every blob is LF. Pin that, so a Windows checkout
# does not rewrite the working tree to CRLF — which made `git status` report all ~200
# tracked files as modified while `git diff` correctly showed no content change
# (core.autocrlf=true flags files that "would differ if checked out").
#
# Pair this with `git config core.autocrlf false` on Windows clones.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures: never touch these.
*.stl binary
*.glb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
